Nature Shock
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to ELEMENTAL_NatureShock 
    Actions
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        -------- Don't change anything here --------
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        Set VariableSet NS_Caster = (Triggering unit)
        Set VariableSet NS_Target = (Target unit of ability being cast)
        Set VariableSet NS_Target_Point = (Position of NS_Target)
        Set VariableSet NS_Level = (Level of ELEMENTAL_NatureShock  for NS_Caster)
        Set VariableSet NS_Roll = (Random integer number between 1 and 100)
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        -------- Here you can change the damage --------
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        Set VariableSet NS_Damage = (80.00 x (Real(NS_Level)))
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        -------- Here you can change the chance to root --------
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        Set VariableSet NS_Rooting_Chance = 50
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        -------- Here you can change the special Effect --------
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        Set VariableSet NS_Special_Effect = Abilities\Spells\Undead\ReplenishHealth\ReplenishHealthCaster.mdl
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        -------- The spell starts to do something --------
        -------- Don't change anyting from here --------
        -------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                NS_Roll Less than or equal to NS_Rooting_Chance
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Create 1 ShockDummy for (Owner of NS_Caster) at NS_Target_Point facing Default building facing degrees
                Unit - Add NatureShockRoot (dummy) to (Last created unit)
                Unit - Order (Last created unit) to Night Elf Keeper Of The Grove - Entangling Roots NS_Target
                Unit - Add a 1.00 second Generic expiration timer to (Last created unit)
            Else - Actions
        Special Effect - Create a special effect at NS_Target_Point using NS_Special_Effect
        Special Effect - Destroy (Last created special effect)
        Unit - Cause NS_Caster to damage NS_Target, dealing NS_Damage damage of attack type Spells and damage type Normal
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NS_Target_Point)
